Subject: [PATCH 04/15] Sprint 3.4: shared-prefix branching from arm-A round-4
 snapshots (--branch_from)

Restores the snapshot, copies prefix logs, refuses branches that differ in non-treatment
params or place treatment inside the prefix. Validated with fake-model tests and, at $0,
against the three real pilot A runs (round-5 prompts reproduced byte-for-byte).

